{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事に終了しましたー\n来てくださった皆様、\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、お疲れ様でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は野外liveで、ステージの上にも天井がない中、天候が凄く心配だったのですが...(桜井は台風女なので"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↓)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青空がずっと先まで広がって\n風は強かったですが、\n日光の自然ライトの中でするパフォーマンスは最高に気持ち良かったです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと残すところは......大阪!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は私、乃木坂としては大阪初上陸"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今からワクワクしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、今隣では\nなーちゃんが爆睡中。\nこの子地味ぃに人の方に寄ってくるので、若干狭いです((笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちから寄っていくと嫌がるクセに、寝てる時は素直に寄ってくる(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、味噌カツ食べました♪\nめっちゃ美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんが\nゆみねぇ、ななみん、その他モロモロに襲われてました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみん、目付きが危ないぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/1266584/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}